  "brandStatement": "The AD Efffect is a bespoke architecture and interior design studio where purpose meets artistry. Rooted in the philosophy of Form Follows Function, our work is shaped by timeless design, authentic materiality, and thoughtful craftsmanship. Each space is carefully composed to evoke a sense of belonging—quietly refined, deeply personal, and designed to endure beyond trends.",
  "story": {
    "title": "THE ART OF BECOMING",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Every remarkable journey begins long before it finds its name. The story of The AD Efffect is one such journey.\nBefore the studio came into existence, there were two distinct perspectives on design. Drishti Advani Chauhan, an architect by profession and a creative at heart, was drawn to the poetic dimensions of architecture—the interplay of light and shadow, the honesty of materials, and the ability of thoughtfully composed spaces to evoke emotion. She believed that every environment should possess a character of its own, one that resonates deeply with the people who inhabit it.\nAmber Chauhan, with a foundation in Civil Engineering and years immersed in architecture and interior design, approached the built environment through the lens of precision, structure, and execution. For him, the integrity of a project lay not only in its visual expression but in the meticulous orchestration of every technical detail that brought an idea to life.\nTheir paths crossed through a shared professional association, but what began as conversations around design gradually revealed something far more meaningful. They discovered a common language one that valued purpose over excess, substance over spectacle, and timelessness over trends. As their partnership evolved in life, so too did their vision for architecture.\nThat vision became The AD Efffect.",
      "The name itself is deeply personal. The initials A and D honour Amber and Drishti, while the three F's in Efffect embody the philosophy that has become the cornerstone of the studio—Form Follows Function. More than a principle, it is a way of thinking that informs every decision, where purpose shapes form and beauty emerges with quiet inevitability.\nToday, The AD Efffect stands at the intersection of imagination and precision, where creative expression is balanced by technical rigour, and every project is approached as an opportunity to craft something singular. Whether designing a private residence, a commercial environment, or a hospitality destination, the ambition remains unchanged—to create spaces that are deeply personal, enduring in character, and remembered not only for how they look, but for how they make people feel.For us, architecture is never the final destination. It is the beginning of countless stories waiting to unfold."
    ],
